<title>ITALY: Italy's Interpump debuts below offer price.</title>
<headline>Italy's Interpump debuts below offer price.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italian pump and piston group Interpump fell below their offer price on the company's first day on the Milan stock market, opening at 5,600 lire per share compared with the placement price of 5,800 lire.</p>
<p>Interpump, the 14th newcomer to the bourse this year, held a public offering of 25.8 million shares which was nearly three times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>By 0955 GMT, Interpump ordinary shares were quoted at 5,400 lire from a low of 5,350 lire.</p>
</text>
